        "text": "The Congressional Budget Office is a credible and trustworthy source of fiscal analysis.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Economic growth is a desirable outcome and justifies tax policy changes even if they benefit wealthier individuals.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Reducing taxes for lower- and middle-income families constitutes meaningful help to those groups.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Fairness in taxation should be measured primarily by distributional impact across income levels rather than by absolute burden or progressivity.",
        "confidence": 0.89
