    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/6/76154.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 53,
    "turn_text": "Well, in fact, it led to the lowest unemployment for African-American and Hispanic workers, as well as the fastest wage growth in a decade. Why do you think it's so hard for people on the left to understand? I mean, these are facts. These aren't partisan arguments.",
